--- !u!114 &1533101512
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1533101511}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 2 | Ders 9 | Render"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. Kure nesnesindeki DenemeMat materyalini
    ve d\xFCzelmi\u015F Kapsul nesnesini inceleyin.\n\nKameran\u0131n g\xF6r\xFC\u015F
    a\xE7\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve k\u0131rpma d\xFCzlemini de\u011Fi\u015Ftiriyoruz.
    Sahneye tel kafes g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFCnde bak\u0131p \xFC\xE7genleri g\xF6r\xFCyoruz.
    Yeni bir materyal olu\u015Fturup rengini, metalli\u011Fini, p\xFCr\xFCzs\xFCzl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC,
    normal haritas\u0131n\u0131 ve \u0131\u015F\u0131mas\u0131n\u0131 ayarl\u0131yoruz.
    Son olarak pembe g\xF6r\xFCnen bir materyali URP'ye d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders09_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Main Camera nesnesini se\xE7in. Field
    of View de\u011Ferini 60 yerine 20, sonra 110 yap\u0131n ve Game penceresine
    bak\u0131n. Projection ayar\u0131n\u0131 Orthographic yap\u0131n, sonra Perspective
    de\u011Ferine geri al\u0131n."
  - "Clipping Planes alt\u0131ndaki Far de\u011Ferini 1000 yerine 8 yap\u0131n. Uzaktaki
    k\xFCp kaybolur. De\u011Feri yeniden 1000 yap\u0131n."
  - "Scene penceresinin Shading Mode men\xFCs\xFCn\xFC a\xE7\u0131n ve Wireframe
    se\xE7in. K\xFCreye yakla\u015F\u0131n, y\xFCzeyin \xFC\xE7genlerden olu\u015Ftu\u011Funu
    g\xF6r\xFCrs\xFCn\xFCz. Game penceresinde Stats d\xFC\u011Fmesini a\xE7\u0131n,
    Verts ve Tris de\u011Ferlerini okuyun. Shading Mode ayar\u0131n\u0131 Shaded
    de\u011Ferine geri al\u0131n."
  - "Project penceresinde sa\u011F t\u0131klay\u0131n, Create men\xFCs\xFCnden Material
    se\xE7in ve ad\u0131n\u0131 DenemeMat yap\u0131n. Inspector'da shader'\u0131n
    Universal Render Pipeline alt\u0131ndaki Lit oldu\u011Funu g\xF6r\xFCn. Materyali
    k\xFCreye s\xFCr\xFCkleyin."
  - "Base Color rengini k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 yap\u0131n. Metallic de\u011Ferini
    0 ile 1 aras\u0131nda, Smoothness de\u011Ferini 0 ile 1 aras\u0131nda gezdirin
    ve her de\u011Fi\u015Fimde k\xFCreye bak\u0131n."
  - "Normal Map alan\u0131na Dokular klas\xF6r\xFCndeki normal_harita dokusunu s\xFCr\xFCkleyin
    ve k\xFCreye yakla\u015F\u0131n. Y\xFCzey kabartmal\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr ama
    \xFC\xE7gen say\u0131s\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Fmez. Emission kutusunu a\xE7\u0131n,
    rengini turuncu yap\u0131n."
  - "Kapsul nesnesini se\xE7in. Materyalinin shader'\u0131 Standard oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in
    pembe g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. Window men\xFCs\xFCnden Rendering, Render Pipeline Converter
    penceresini a\xE7\u0131n. Built-in to URP se\xE7in, Material Upgrade kutusunu
    i\u015Faretleyin, Initialize Converters ve Convert Assets d\xFC\u011Fmelerine
    bas\u0131n. Kaps\xFCl d\xFCzelir."
  kendinDene:
  - "DenemeMat materyalinde Base Map alan\u0131na metal_doku dokusunu s\xFCr\xFCkleyin.
    Metallic 1 ve Smoothness 0.6 ile nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor?"
  - "Kamerada Projection ayar\u0131n\u0131 Orthographic yap\u0131n ve Size de\u011Ferini
    de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin. Nesnelerin boyutu uzakl\u0131\u011Fa g\xF6re de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor
    mu?"
  - "K\xFCpe ikinci bir materyal olu\u015Fturun ve Surface Type ayar\u0131n\u0131
    Transparent yap\u0131n. Base Color rengindeki Alpha de\u011Ferini d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCn."
